discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Critical]** `dispatchedNotifications` dedup is keyed on GitHub's stable thread id, causing permanent thread deafness after one dispatch. — Failure scenario: GitHub notification `id` identifies a thread (not an event). After poll 1 dispatches, the id is recorded. On poll 2 the same thread with new events is `continue`d before any lane runs. Thread muted until 500 other threads displace it.

```suggestion
const notifId = `${notification.id}|${notification.updated_at}`;
if (this.isDispatched(this.cursor.dispatchedNotifications, notifId)) {
  continue;
}
```

<details>
<summary>中文说明</summary>

`dispatchedNotifications` 的去重键是 GitHub 的稳定线程 id，导致线程在一次下发后永久失聪。GitHub 通知 `id` 标识的是线程而非事件。第 1 轮下发后记录该 id，第 2 轮同线程有新事件时在 lane 执行前被 `continue` 跳过，线程静音直到 500 个其他线程将其挤出。

</details>

_— qwen3.7-max via Qwen Code /review_

